WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:01.585
- Dear Spike...

00:00:02.169 --> 00:00:03.128
- Dear Oprah...

00:00:03.212 --> 00:00:05.923
- Dear Stevie,
your music has guided me

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:08.592
through the most difficult moments
of my life.

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:12.721
- I get letters from so many
people that share their stories.

00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:16.517
♪ I keep fighting voices
in my mind ♪

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.479
♪ That say I'm not enough ♪

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:25.567
- Wow! Are all of these letters
for me?

00:00:25.651 --> 00:00:27.903
♪ Remind me once again... ♪

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:30.739
- Every time you make something,
you're throwing rocks in a pond.

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:34.326
You have no idea of the ripples
that are going to come back to you.

00:00:34.409 --> 00:00:35.827
Every time you make something.

00:00:35.911 --> 00:00:38.163
- All of us must
stand up together.

00:00:38.247 --> 00:00:44.044
- If one person tells their story,
that allows other people to say...

00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:46.463
- You know what? That happened to me.
That's me there.

00:00:46.547 --> 00:00:50.175
- It's as though I'm watching my life
and the lives of my students on screen.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:58.308
- I could speak to people about their
problems because I grew up struggling.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.687
- You're fat, you're too brown.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:04.815
Ballet was the first time I felt
like, "Wow, I'm beautiful."

00:01:06.817 --> 00:01:09.820
- With you as an example,
I've become the first black woman

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:12.155
to get a Ph.D.
in aerospace engineering.

00:01:12.239 --> 00:01:14.825
- I knew that I could
defy the odds, too.

00:01:15.576 --> 00:01:17.077
- (whispering) Oh, my gosh.

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:18.912
- That can transform everything.

00:01:18.996 --> 00:01:21.832
♪ You say I'm loved... ♪

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:24.001
- Big Bird, you showed me
how to accept people

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:26.628
for who they truly are,
starting with myself.

00:01:27.588 --> 00:01:30.716
- Your music helped me create
the Equal Justice Initiative.

00:01:30.799 --> 00:01:34.011
- That inspires me to want to write
more songs and play them better.

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:37.139
- You lit a fire inside of us,
and we're lighting that same fire

00:01:37.222 --> 00:01:39.349
in other kids around the world.

00:01:39.433 --> 00:01:42.269
- If every one of us focused on
something that you want to change,

00:01:42.352 --> 00:01:44.021
we can change the world.

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:47.274
- Your legacy is every life
you've touched.

00:01:48.233 --> 00:01:50.027
♪ Oh, I believe ♪

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:52.112
- Dear Spike...

00:01:52.196 --> 00:01:53.697
- Dear Lin...

00:01:53.822 --> 00:01:55.240
- Dear Stevie...

00:01:55.324 --> 00:01:56.533
- Dear Oprah...

00:01:56.825 --> 00:01:58.035
- Dear Gloria...

00:01:58.368 --> 00:01:59.953
- Dear Big Bird...

00:02:00.204 --> 00:02:01.496
- Dear Jane...

00:02:01.997 --> 00:02:03.415
- Dear Aly...

00:02:03.498 --> 00:02:04.875
- Dear Yara...

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.460
- Dear Misty...

00:02:06.543 --> 00:02:09.129
- Your influence on me changed
the course of my life.

00:02:09.213 --> 00:02:11.048
- Dear Gloria...
- Dear Jane...

00:02:14.885 --> 00:02:16.470
- There's a line from "In The Heights"

00:02:16.553 --> 00:02:19.056
that says wherever we go,
we rep our people.

00:02:19.139 --> 00:02:21.975
Because of you,
wherever my life takes me,

00:02:22.059 --> 00:02:25.103
I will always represent my people.

00:02:25.187 --> 00:02:27.481
- Thank you...
Thank you.

